Package: fluxglass
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Recommends: lm-sensors, pciutils
Maintainer: Fluxglass Contributors <unattachedgray@users.noreply.github.com>
